      "content": "**Critique on Sample Preparation Fidelity**\nThe characterization of sample synthesis lacks critical detail; specifically, the deposition environment and stoichiometry control require more explicit documentation. Furthermore, the procedures for surface termination and cleaning must be rigorously elaborated to ensure experimental rigor.\n\n**Evaluation of Data Presentation and Uncertainty**\nThe statistical robustness of the experimental findings is questionable. We request a detailed justification for the chosen error propagation method, as the current uncertainty estimates appear insufficiently correlated with experimental noise.\n\n**Recommendations for Statistical Depth**\nBeyond the error bars, the manuscript needs to present more comprehensive data on sample variance across replicates. Reporting the null hypothesis testing results alongside the observed effects will significantly solidify the interpretation of the physical findings.",
